====== Ubiquiti LiteAP AC ======

{{:media:ubiquiti:liteap:lap120-cover.jpg?nolink&0x200|}}

The [[https://www.ui.com/airmax/liteap-ac/|Ubiquiti LiteAP AC]] is a family of lightweight 802.11ac outdoor access points with a 120º sector antenna and one Gigabit Ethernet port based on the AR9342 SoC. It consists of two devices:
  * the **LAP-120** (previously known as LiteBeam™ AC AP or LBE-5AC-16-120), which has a 16 dBi antenna
  * the **LAP-GPS**, which has a 17 dBi sector antenna, a GPS receiver and a 2.4 GHz management radio


