===== Failsafe mode =====
During power on, the blue LED will blink for a few seconds. During this time, press the "RESET" button with a sharp object (i.e. a paper clip) a few times until the LED blinks faster. In a few moments the device will enter failsafe mode. You can read more about the [[docs:guide-user:troubleshooting:failsafe_and_factory_reset|failsafe mode in OpenWrt here]].


