^ CPU/Speed         | 535 MHz                                  |
^ Flash-Chip        | MX25L12805D                              |
^ Flash size        | 16 MiB                                    |
^ RAM               | 64 MiB                                   |
^ Wireless          | Qualcomm QCA988X 802.11ac                |
^ Ethernet          | 1x 10/100/1000 port (AR8035-A chip)      |
^ USB               | N/A                                      |
